          "html": "<section class=\"revealPart\" id=\"focus-paragraph-2-0\">\n<h3>完整原文 · 第2段</h3>\n<p>First coined in 2010 by user experience expert Harry Brignull, “dark patterns” is a catch- all term for practices that manipulate user interfaces to influence the decision-making ability of users. Brignull identifies 12 types of common dark patterns, ranging from misdirection and hidden costs to “roach motel,” where a user experience seems easy and intuitive at the start, but turns difficult when the user tries to get out.</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"revealPart\" id=\"focus-paragraph-2-1\">\n<h3>意群划分 · 第2段</h3>\n<p>First coined in 2010 by user experience expert Harry Brignull, / “dark patterns” is a catch- all term for practices / that manipulate user interfaces to influence the decision-making ability of users. / Brignull identifies 12 types of common dark patterns, / ranging from misdirection and hidden costs to “roach motel,” / where a user experience seems easy and intuitive at the start, / but turns difficult / when the user tries to get out.</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"revealPart\" id=\"focus-paragraph-2-2\">\n<h3>意群翻译 · 第2段</h3>\n<p style=\"line-height:1.8;color:#2563eb;font-weight:500\">用户体验专家 Harry Brignull 于 2010 年首次提出 / “黑暗模式”是实践的总称 / 操纵用户界面来影响用户的决策能力<br>Brignull 识别出 12 种常见的深色图案 / 从误导和隐性成本到“蟑螂汽车旅馆”， / 用户体验一开始就显得简单直观 / 但变得困难 / 当用户试图出去时</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"revealPart\" id=\"focus-paragraph-2-3\">\n<h3>标准译文 · 第2段</h3>\n<p>“黑暗模式”由用户体验专家 Harry Brignull 于 2010 年首次提出，是一个包罗万象的术语，指的是操纵用户界面以影响用户决策能力的实践。 Brignull 识别了 12 种常见的暗模式，从误导和隐藏成本到“蟑螂汽车旅馆”，用户体验一开始似乎简单直观，但当用户试图离开时就会变得困难。</p>\n</section>",
