          "html": "<section class=\"revealPart\" id=\"focus-paragraph-1-0\">\n<h3>完整原文 · 第1段</h3>\n<p>Although ethics classes are common around the world, scientists are unsure if their lessons can actually change behavior; evidence either way is weak, relying on contrived laboratory tests or sometimes unreliable self-reports. But a new study published in Cognition found that, in at least one real-world situation, a single ethics lesson may have had lasting effects.</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"revealPart\" id=\"focus-paragraph-1-1\">\n<h3>意群划分 · 第1段</h3>\n<p>Although ethics classes are common around the world, / scientists are unsure / if their lessons can actually change behavior; / evidence either way is weak, / relying on contrived laboratory tests or sometimes unreliable self-reports. / But a new study published in Cognition found that, / in at least one real-world situation, / a single ethics lesson may have had lasting effects.</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"revealPart\" id=\"focus-paragraph-1-2\">\n<h3>意群翻译 · 第1段</h3>\n<p style=\"line-height:1.8;color:#2563eb;font-weight:500\">尽管道德课程在世界各地都很常见 / 科学家不确定 / 如果他们的课程确实可以改变行为 / 无论哪种方式的证据都很薄弱 / 依赖人为的实验室测试或有时不可靠的自我报告<br>但发表在《认知》上的一项新研究发现 / 至少在一种现实情况下 / 一次道德教训可能会产生持久的影响</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"revealPart\" id=\"focus-paragraph-1-3\">\n<h3>标准译文 · 第1段</h3>\n<p>尽管道德课程在世界各地很常见，但科学家们不确定他们的课程是否真的能改变行为；无论哪种方式，证据都很薄弱，依赖于人为的实验室测试或有时不可靠的自我报告。但发表在《认知》杂志上的一项新研究发现，至少在一个现实世界的情况下，一堂道德课可能会产生持久的影响。</p>\n</section>",
