          "title": "第3段 · 篇章精读",
          "html": "<section class=\"revealPart\" id=\"focus-paragraph-3-0\">\n<h3>完整原文 · 第3段</h3>\n<p>Schwitzgebel predicted the intervention would have no effect; he had previously found that ethics professors do not differ from other professors on a range of behaviors, including voting rates, blood donation and returning library books. But among student subjects who discussed meat ethics, meal purchases containing meat decreased from 52 to 45 percent— and this effect held steady for the study’s duration of several weeks. Purchases from the other group remained at 52 percent.</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"revealPart\" id=\"focus-paragraph-3-1\">\n<h3>意群划分 · 第3段</h3>\n<p>Schwitzgebel predicted the intervention would have no effect; / he had previously found / that ethics professors do not differ from other professors on a range of behaviors, / including voting rates, / blood donation and returning library books. / But among student subjects / who discussed meat ethics, / meal purchases containing meat decreased from 52 to 45 percent— / and this effect held steady for the study’s duration of several weeks. / Purchases from the other group remained at 52 percent.</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"revealPart\" id=\"focus-paragraph-3-2\">\n<h3>意群翻译 · 第3段</h3>\n<p style=\"line-height:1.8;color:#2563eb;font-weight:500\">施维茨格贝尔预测干预不会有效果 / 他之前发现 / 伦理学教授在一系列行为上与其他教授没有什么不同 / 包括投票率 / 献血和归还图书馆书籍<br>但在学生科目中 / 谁讨论了肉类伦理 / 含有肉类的膳食购买量从 52% 下降至 45% / 在研究的几周内，这种效应保持稳定<br>来自另一组的购买量仍保持在 52%</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"revealPart\" id=\"focus-paragraph-3-3\">\n<h3>标准译文 · 第3段</h3>\n<p>施维茨格贝尔预测干预不会产生任何效果；他此前发现，伦理学教授在一系列行为上与其他教授没有什么不同，包括投票率、献血和归还图书馆书籍。但在讨论肉类伦理的学生受试者中，购买含有肉类的膳食的比例从 52% 下降到 45%，而且这种影响在研究持续数周的时间内保持稳定。来自另一组的购买量仍保持在 52%。</p>\n</section>",
